msgid "[Read more on Wikidata](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Wikidata:For_developers)"
msgstr "[ویکی ݙیٹا تے ٻیا پڑھو](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Wikidata:For_developers)"

